{"id":"level-up-2026-10-01","name":"2026-10-01 每日卡片","project":"level-up-cards","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/tree/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45","sentences":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-01:s651","en":"There is a coffee stain on the edge of the map.","zh":"地图边缘有一处咖啡渍。","note":"stain · 染污；给…着色；污点 · a coffee stain","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-01:s652","en":"The survey asked pupils about their daily physical activity.","zh":"调查询问了学生每天的身体活动情况。","note":"physical · 身体的，肉体的；物理的，物理学的；物质的，有形的；体检 · physical activity","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-01:s653","en":"The course examines how online retailing has changed high streets.","zh":"这门课考察网络零售如何改变商业街。","note":"retailing · 零售业 · online retailing","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-01:s654","en":"The organisers worked hard to fulfil their promise of free admission.","zh":"组织者努力兑现免费入场的承诺。","note":"fulfil · 实现， 完成； 满足 · fulfil a promise","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-01:s655","en":"She peeled a mandarin and shared the segments with me.","zh":"她剥开一个橘子，把橘瓣分给我。","note":"mandarin · 橘子； 达官贵人， 官僚； [M-] 普通话 · a mandarin orange","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-01:s656","en":"A clear structure helps readers follow a long report.","zh":"清晰的结构帮助读者理解长篇报告。","note":"structure · 结构；构造；建筑物；系统安排； 精心组织 · a clear structure","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-01:s657","en":"The gardener tied the young tree to a wooden stake.","zh":"园丁把小树系在一根木桩上。","note":"stake · 桩；火刑柱；利害关系；股份； · a wooden stake","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-01:s658","en":"The students measured light intensity at different distances from the lamp.","zh":"学生们测量了距灯不同距离处的光强。","note":"intensity · 强烈， 剧烈； 强度 · light intensity","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-01:s659","en":"We were lucky enough to witness the first snowfall.","zh":"我们很幸运地亲眼看到了第一场雪。","note":"witness · 目击； 为…作证；证据；目击者 · witness an event","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-01:s660","en":"The library books are due back at the end of this week.","zh":"图书馆的书到本周末就该归还了。","note":"due · 到期的， 预期的； 应有的， 应得的； 正当的 · due back","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-01:s661","en":"All entries must conform to the exhibition's size requirements.","zh":"所有参展作品都必须符合展览的尺寸要求。","note":"conform · 遵守， 服从； 适应， 顺应； 相一致， 相符合 · conform to standards","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-01:s662","en":"Opening both windows improves air circulation in the small room.","zh":"把两扇窗都打开，能改善小房间的空气流通。","note":"circulation · 循环， 流通； 流传， 传播； 发行， 发行量 · air circulation","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-01:s663","en":"Her diary provides an authentic account of everyday village life.","zh":"她的日记真实记录了村庄的日常生活。","note":"authentic · 真品的， 真迹的； 真正的， 真实的， 逼真的 · an authentic account","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-01:s664","en":"We prepared a contingency plan in case the outdoor venue flooded.","zh":"我们准备了应急方案，以防户外场地被淹。","note":"contingency · 偶然性， 可能性； 意外事件； 附带事件 · a contingency plan","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-01:s665","en":"The coach told players never to taunt their opponents.","zh":"教练告诉队员绝不能嘲讽对手。","note":"taunt · 嘲笑，讥笑 · taunt an opponent","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-01:s666","en":"The exhibition lets contemporary paintings intermix with older works.","zh":"展览让当代绘画与较早时期的作品交错陈列。","note":"intermix · 混入， 混杂 · intermix with","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-01:s667","en":"Please inform the office of any changes to your address.","zh":"地址有任何变动，请通知办公室。","note":"inform · 通知； 向…报告 · inform someone of","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-01:s668","en":"The picnic will depend on whether the weather improves.","zh":"能否野餐取决于天气是否好转。","note":"depend · 依靠， 依赖； 信赖， 相信； 决定于， 视…而定 · depend on","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-01:s669","en":"There is a dearth of affordable rehearsal spaces nearby.","zh":"附近缺乏价格可负担的排练场所。","note":"dearth · 缺乏， 短缺 · a dearth of","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-01:s670","en":"The charity will commit additional resources to the reading programme.","zh":"慈善机构将为阅读项目投入更多资源。","note":"commit · 把…交托给， 提交； 犯， 干 · commit resources","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-01:s671","en":"The claim needs stronger empirical evidence before we accept it.","zh":"这个主张需要更有力的实证证据，我们才会接受。","note":"empirical · 经验主义的， 以经验为依据的 · empirical evidence","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-01:s672","en":"Each bakery tried to outdo its rivals with elaborate cakes.","zh":"每家面包店都试图用精致蛋糕胜过对手。","note":"outdo · 超越， 胜过 · outdo a rival","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-01:s673","en":"The poem expresses deep sorrow at the loss of home.","zh":"这首诗表达了失去家园的深切悲伤。","note":"sorrow · 悲哀； 伤心事 · deep sorrow","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-01:s674","en":"We need to curb spending until ticket sales improve.","zh":"门票销售好转前，我们需要控制开支。","note":"curb · 控制，抑制，约束；路缘， 镶边石； 马勒； 起限制作用的事物 · curb spending","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-01:s675","en":"A sudden computer crash erased the changes I had not saved.","zh":"电脑突然崩溃，导致我未保存的修改丢失。","note":"crash · 碰撞；冲，闯；倒下，坠落；发出撞击声；垮台，破产；速成的；碰撞；坠落，坠毁；破裂声，撞击声 · a computer crash","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-01:s676","en":"The chart compares annual precipitation across five mountain stations.","zh":"这张图比较了五个山地站点的年降水量。","note":"precipitation · 降雨， 降水； 仓促， 急躁； 【化】 沉淀作用 · annual precipitation","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-01:s677","en":"The room has a balcony in addition to large windows.","zh":"房间除了大窗户之外，还有一个阳台。","note":"in addition to · 之外（还有，也） · in addition to","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-01:s678","en":"The central character gradually learns to trust her neighbours.","zh":"主人公逐渐学会了信任邻居。","note":"character · 性格， 品质； 性质， 特性； 人物， 角色； 符号， 字 · a central character","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-01:s679","en":"The teacher used iron filings to reveal the magnetic field.","zh":"老师用铁屑展示磁场。","note":"magnetic · 磁的， 有磁性的； 有吸引力的 · a magnetic field","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-01:s680","en":"The research paper compares cholesterol levels across different study groups.","zh":"这篇研究论文比较了不同研究组的胆固醇水平。","note":"cholesterol · 胆固醇 · cholesterol levels","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-01:s681","en":"The animation shows a satellite moving into orbit around Earth.","zh":"动画展示了一颗卫星进入环绕地球的轨道。","note":"orbit · 沿轨道运行； 围绕…运动；轨道；影响范围，势力范围 · orbit the Earth","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-01:s682","en":"A local band played outside the market on Saturday.","zh":"一支本地乐队周六在市场外演奏。","note":"band · 乐队； 群， 伙； 带， 箍； 条纹； 波段， 频带；用带绑扎 · a local band","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-01:s683","en":"Each resident received a letter about the proposed road changes.","zh":"每位居民都收到了一封关于道路变更提案的信。","note":"resident · 常驻的， 居住的；居民，住户 · a local resident","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-01:s684","en":"The exhibition will comprise photographs, maps, and recorded interviews.","zh":"展览将由照片、地图和访谈录音组成。","note":"comprise · 包含； 由…组成 · comprise several parts","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-01:s685","en":"The sign gives the bridge's height above the river.","zh":"标志给出了桥梁距河面的高度。","note":"height · 海拔； 身高 · at a height of","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-01:s686","en":"The plants grow best in moderate temperatures with indirect sunlight.","zh":"这些植物在温和的气温和间接日照下生长最好。","note":"moderate · 温和的；适度的['mɒdəreɪt]；减轻， 缓和； 使适中 · moderate temperatures","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-01:s687","en":"He repaired an old radio receiver found in the attic.","zh":"他修好了在阁楼里发现的一台旧收音机。","note":"receiver · 听筒； 接收器 · a radio receiver","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-01:s688","en":"Our hamster stores small pieces of food inside its bedding.","zh":"我们的仓鼠把小块食物藏在垫料里面。","note":"hamster · 仓鼠 · a pet hamster","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-01:s689","en":"This module introduces basic research methods through practical exercises.","zh":"这个课程单元通过实践练习介绍基础研究方法。","note":"module · 模块； 模式； 舱； 组件； 单元 · a course module","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-01:s690","en":"The new mall includes a library beside its main entrance.","zh":"新购物中心的主入口旁设有一家图书馆。","note":"mall · 购物中心 · a shopping mall","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-01:s691","en":"The new windows made a substantial difference to winter heating costs.","zh":"新窗户显著改变了冬季取暖费用。","note":"substantial · 可观的， 大量的； 坚固的， 结实的； 实质的； 大体上的 · a substantial improvement","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-01:s692","en":"The team rehearsed carefully to execute the complex scene smoothly.","zh":"团队认真排练，以顺利完成那个复杂场景。","note":"execute · 将…处死； 实施， 执行 · execute a plan","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-01:s693","en":"Students benefit from discussing their ideas with different classmates.","zh":"与不同同学讨论自己的想法能让学生受益。","note":"benefit · 使受益；有益于， · benefit from","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-01:s694","en":"The baker added malt extract to give the loaf a richer flavour.","zh":"面包师加入麦芽提取物，使面包风味更浓郁。","note":"malt · 把…制成麦芽； 变成麦芽；麦芽；麦芽酒 · malt extract","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-01:s695","en":"We bought tickets at the booth beside the ferry terminal.","zh":"我们在渡轮码头旁的售票亭买了票。","note":"booth · 小房间； 公用电话亭； 售货棚 · a ticket booth","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-01:s696","en":"The workshop offers a unique opportunity to study original manuscripts.","zh":"这个工作坊提供了研究原始手稿的独特机会。","note":"unique · 唯一的， 独一无二的； 极不寻常的， 极好的 · a unique opportunity","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-01:s697","en":"A successful rehearsal helped boost the young performers' confidence.","zh":"一次成功的排练帮助年轻表演者增强了信心。","note":"boost · 使增长，使兴旺；鼓励，促进；为…作宣传，宣扬；增加， 提高； 帮助， 激励 · boost confidence","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-01:s698","en":"He offered a sincere apology for interrupting the presentation.","zh":"他为打断演讲而诚恳道歉。","note":"sincere · 真挚的， 诚挚的， 真诚的， 诚恳的 · a sincere apology","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-01:s699","en":"The guide explained why small boats can capsize in rough water.","zh":"导游解释了小船为何会在汹涌水面上倾覆。","note":"capsize · 翻， 倾覆 · capsize in rough water","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-01:s700","en":"The archive holds letters sent to the education ministry.","zh":"档案馆保存着寄给教育部的信件。","note":"ministry · 部 · the education ministry","recordings":[]}],"words":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-01:w651","en":"stain","zh":"染污；给…着色；污点","note":"英 /steɪn/ · 美 /sten/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/0651-uk-67d4b2e95d85.mp3","text":"stain"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/0651-us-e9605fb6dec3.mp3","text":"stain"}]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-01:w652","en":"physical","zh":"身体的，肉体的；物理的，物理学的；物质的，有形的；体检","note":"英 /'fɪzɪkl/ · 美 /'fɪzɪkl/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/0652-uk-8786d28c07d5.mp3","text":"physical"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/0652-us-0426736c6134.mp3","text":"physical"}]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-01:w653","en":"retailing","zh":"零售业","note":"英 /'riːteɪlɪŋ/ · 美 /'ritelɪŋ/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/0653-uk-79dc8004b77b.mp3","text":"retailing"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751